  democracy estimate std.error odds.ratio or.low or.high
      <dbl>    <dbl>     <dbl>      <dbl>  <dbl>   <dbl>
1         0    0.191    0.0772      1.21   1.04     1.41
2         1   -0.283    0.207       0.754  0.502    1.13
```


:::
